      "Id": "ba10d1b9-d755-4f92-a4fb-e8add26a5515",
      "Title": "This example needs a camera\n\n1. Select the [VideoDeviceInput] op\n2. Pick your camera in the InputDeviceName field\n3. Tick [Active]\n\nThen change [PickTexture]'s [Index] input (0-6) to flip between the seven operators' debug views - the selected operator runs on the camera image, and only while it is selected are its outputs available.",
